gridcoinresearch (5.5.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  gridcointestnetd-autounlock@.service now reads the wallet passphrase
  credential from /etc/credstore.encrypted/gridcointestnet-<user>.wallet-passphrase,
  the same location mainnet uses. The previous location,
  /etc/gridcoin-testnet/<user>-wallet-passphrase.cred, is no longer read, so
  automatic unlocking stops until the credential is moved.

  Move an existing credential before upgrading:
      sudo install -d -m 0700 /etc/credstore.encrypted
      sudo mv /etc/gridcoin-testnet/<user>-wallet-passphrase.cred \
          /etc/credstore.encrypted/gridcointestnet-<user>.wallet-passphrase

 -- Richard Leckinger <caraka@gridcoin.us>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 17:46:37 -0500
